#: ../../docs/user-manual/mc.md:1 4b74feaf2faf4be5afeb7d29f5070b40
msgid "Monte Carlo"
msgstr "蒙特卡罗"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/mc.md:3 28e122e7f8c5466f9b27a724353c2af2
msgid "Particle status"
msgstr "粒子状态"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/mc.md:5 a6dc5ae5c7ef4807be9ab0f608dc8fd4
msgid ""
"The status of an MC particle is the `m_statusFlags` branch of "
"`TMcEvent/m_mcParticleCol` in a DST:"
msgstr "MC 粒子的状态是 DST 中 `TMcEvent/m_mcParticleCol` 的 `m_statusFlags` branch："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/mc.md:17 4abe63fbb2404fe494f535f4ffb288dc
msgid ""
"It is a bit field defined by BOSS as `Event::McParticle::StatusBits`: bit"
" 0 `DECAYED` (the particle comes from the generator), bit 1 `DECAYFLT` "
"(produced in flight by Geant4), bit 2 `PRIMARY` and bit 3 `LEAF` (no "
"daughter). Several bits can be set at the same time, e.g. `5` is `PRIMARY"
" | DECAYED`."
msgstr ""
"它是由 BOSS 定义为 `Event::McParticle::StatusBits` 的位字段：bit 0 "
"`DECAYED`（粒子来自产生子）、bit 1 `DECAYFLT`（由 Geant4 在飞行中产生）、bit 2 `PRIMARY`、bit "
"3 `LEAF`（无子粒子）。多个位可以同时置位，例如 `5` 表示 `PRIMARY | DECAYED`。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/mc.md:22 9cd93847b21a45228bde6304b52f9a88
msgid ""
"`particle_is_primary`, `particle_is_leaf`, "
"`particle_decay_from_generator` and `particle_decay_in_flight` decode "
"them one by one. The calling convention is identical for scalar, NumPy "
"array, and Awkward Array inputs:"
msgstr ""
"`particle_is_primary`、`particle_is_leaf`、`particle_decay_from_generator` "
"与 `particle_decay_in_flight` 逐个解码这些标志位。标量、NumPy 数组与 Awkward Array "
"三种输入的调用方式完全一致："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/mc.md dbbf68ab5e844f298a1f2d0bd71ba48f
msgid "Scalar"
msgstr "标量"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/mc.md b364d7606fa5423bb826ef82fd0f0461
msgid "NumPy array"
msgstr "NumPy 数组"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/mc.md e15d2a1dfbbf48579ddd2231c1f4ec97
msgid "Awkward Array"
msgstr "Awkward Array"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/mc.md:74 8f9fbd7a34ac429e82987b4d28ddc242
msgid ""
"`parse_particle_status` (in `pybes3.mc`, not re-exported at the top "
"level) decodes all flags at once. It returns a `dict` for scalar and "
"NumPy input, and an `ak.Array` with the fields `is_primary`, `is_leaf`, "
"`decay_from_generator` and `decay_in_flight` for Awkward input:"
msgstr ""
"`parse_particle_status`（位于 `pybes3.mc`，未在顶层重新导出）一次性解码所有标志位。对标量与 NumPy "
"输入返回 `dict`，对 Awkward 输入返回带 `is_primary`、`is_leaf`、`decay_from_generator`"
" 与 `decay_in_flight` 字段的 `ak.Array`："

